{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19278","headline":"和令狐相公九日对黄白二菊花见怀 · 刘禹锡","name":"和令狐相公九日对黄白二菊花见怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素萼迎寒秀，金英带露香。\n繁华照旄钺，荣盛对银黄。\n琮璧交辉映，衣裳杂彩章。\n晴云遥盖覆，秋蝶近悠扬。\n空想逢九日，何由陪一觞。\n满丛佳色在，未肯委严霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}